      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-16",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Iron Pipeline Review Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms and Explosives to report annually to Congress on firearms trafficked along Interstate 95. The report must include an analysis of the firearms trafficked and contain legislative proposals to counter the firearms trafficking.</p>",
